Description: A computational framework for single-cell RNA-seq data that integrates
    pharmacogenomics profiles to uncover therapeutic heterogeneity within tumors at
    single-cell resolution. The tool prioritizes tailored drugs and provides insights
    into combination therapy regimens and drug toxicity in cancers.
